    "# Spotify Data Analysis - Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)\n",
    "\n",
    "## Project Overview\n",
    "**Author:** Senior Data Science Team  \n",
    "**Dataset:** Spotify Tracks Dataset (114,000 tracks, 114 genres)  \n",
    "**Tech Stack:** Python, Pandas, NumPy, Matplotlib, Seaborn, Plotly  \n",
    "**Objective:** Discover trends, patterns, artist performance, genre insights, popularity drivers, and audio feature relationships.\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## Table of Contents\n",
    "1. [Environment Setup](#setup)\n",
    "2. [Data Understanding](#understanding)\n",
    "3. [Data Cleaning](#cleaning)\n",
    "4. [Univariate Analysis](#univariate)\n",
    "5. [Bivariate Analysis](#bivariate)\n",
    "6. [Multivariate Analysis](#multivariate)\n",
    "7. [Temporal Analysis](#temporal)\n",
    "8. [Advanced Analysis](#advanced)\n",
    "9. [Business Questions & Answers](#business)\n",
    "10. [Business Insights](#insights)\n",
    "11. [Executive Summary](#executive)\n"
   ]
